── General
?        help                                                       
q        close, or quit at the root                                 
esc      back out one level                                         
ctrl+c   cancel the running command, else quit                      
tab      next pane                                                  
gm       messages and the last failure                              
── Move
gg       top                                                        
G        bottom                                                     
j/down   down a line                                                
k/up     up a line                                                  
ctrl+d   half a page down                                           
ctrl+u   half a page up                                             
── Jump
n        repeat the last motion                                     
N        repeat the last motion backward                            
]h       next hunk                                                  
[h       previous hunk                                              
]f       next file                                                  
[f       previous file                                              
]]       next chapter                                               jj log -r 'children(<rev>)'
[[       previous chapter                                           jj log -r 'first_parent(<rev>)'
]u       next unread                                                
[u       previous unread                                            
]r       next round                                                 jj interdiff --from <a> --to <b>
[r       previous round                                             jj interdiff --from <a> --to <b>
── Read
space    mark the hunk read                                         
U        only what is unread                                        
H        choose the round to compare against                        jj evolog -r <rev>
── View
\s       side by side                                               
── Look
p        dock the diff beside the log, following the cursor         jj diff -r <rev> --git
── Files
*        history: the changes that touched the file                 jj log -r 'files(<file>) & (::(@ | <rev>) | <revset>)'
